:{"operationId":"forget","summary":"Forget a preference","description":"Forget one remembered preference by its id from list_memory. Later videos leave it out. Cost: Free: no credits. Same as the MCP tool forget.","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Forget a preference","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Result"}}}},"400":{"description":"The request is invalid. The message names each field to fix.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A valid bearer token (API key or OAuth access token) is required.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"402":{"description":"This account has no allowance left for this, or does not include it. error.checkout_url is where to add it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"This needs publishing permission (scope clypmint.publish), or is not open on this account yet.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"The video, upload, memory or calendar was not found in this account.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Busy: an upload or edit is already running, the video changed, or too many upload links are waiting.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Clypmint could not apply it as asked; error.problems names each part.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"A daily limit was reached (direct edits, caption fixes, upload links).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"501":{"description":"This is not available on Clypmint yet; the message says what to use instead.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Clypmint is busy. Try again in a moment.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/videos/batch":{"post":{"operationId":"create_videos","summary":"Make up to 10 faceless videos","description":"Make up to 10 faceless videos in one call (more: batches of 10; a month of posts is plan_content), each from an idea or an exact script, with shared defaults (seconds, style_id, formats, voice: matilda/sarah/jessica/alice/liam/chris/brian/george/roger/laura/charlie/river/will/eric/bella/daniel/lily/bill/adam/callum/harry, sound_effects). Every item is checked before any starts; each is idempotent on its own operation id (operation_id.N), so a retry never makes doubles. Each video costs 3 credits to make, plus 1 for each started minute of voice-over and 1 for each started minute of finished video after the first, plus 2 for each extra format; dry_run: true answers the total and starts nothing. Returns the video ids; check each with check_video, then schedule_plan. Cost: About 4 credits per 30-second video (3 credits to make, plus 1 for each started minute of voice-over and 1 for each started minute of finished video after the first, plus 2 for each extra format). Same as the MCP tool create_videos.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"items":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":10,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"idea":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":4000},"script":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":4000},"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120},"operation_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-zA-Z0-9_.:-]{1,100}$","description":"A stable ID for this request. Preserve it on retries. Use a new ID only for a deliberate new request."},"seconds":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number","const":15},{"type":"number","const":30},{"type":"number","const":60}]},"instructions":{"type":"string","maxLength":8000},"style_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z0-9-]{1,40}$"},"style_version":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":10000},"format":{"type":"string","enum":["vertical","horizontal"]},"formats":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["9:16","16:9","1:1","4:5"]},"description":"Every shape to make, the main one first: 9:16, 16:9, 1:1, 4:5."},"voice":{"type":"string","enum":["matilda","sarah","jessica","alice","liam","chris","brian","george","roger","laura","charlie","river","will","eric","bella","daniel","lily","bill","adam","callum","harry"],"description":"The narrator for a video made from words: matilda, sarah, jessica, alice, liam, chris, brian, george, roger, laura, charlie, river, will, eric, bella, daniel, lily, bill, adam, callum, harry (sarah: calm, reassuring, health and money; alice: a clear British educator; brian: deep documentary; liam: energetic ads). Leave out to let Clypmint pick one that fits the words. \"Voice: <name>\" in instructions does the same."},"sound_effects":{"type":"boolean"},"purpose":{"type":"string","enum":["organic","ad","youtube","sales_page"],"description":"organic (a post), ad (three openings by default), youtube (horizontal), sales_page."},"asset_ids":{"maxItems":50,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^src_[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{7,95}$"}},"music_staging_key":{"type":"string","pattern":"^stg_[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{7,95}$"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"Up to 10 videos, each with exactly one of idea or script."},"defaults":{"description":"Settings every item gets unless it says otherwise.","type":"object","properties":{"seconds":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number","const":15},{"type":"number","const":30},{"type":"number","const":60}]},"instructions":{"type":"string","maxLength":8000},"style_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z0-9-]{1,40}$"},"style_version":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":10000},"format":{"type":"string","enum":["vertical","horizontal"]},"formats":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["9:16","16:9","1:1","4:5"]},"description":"Every shape to make, the main one first: 9:16, 16:9, 1:1, 4:5."},"voice":{"type":"string","enum":["matilda","sarah","jessica","alice","liam","chris","brian","george","roger","laura","charlie","river","will","eric","bella","daniel","lily","bill","adam","callum","harry"],"description":"The narrator for a video made from words: matilda, sarah, jessica, alice, liam, chris, brian, george, roger, laura, charlie, river, will, eric, bella, daniel, lily, bill, adam, callum, harry (sarah: calm, reassuring, health and money; alice: a clear British educator; brian: deep documentary; liam: energetic ads). Leave out to let Clypmint pick one that fits the words. \"Voice: <name>\" in instructions does the same."},"sound_effects":{"type":"boolean"},"purpose":{"type":"string","enum":["organic","ad","youtube","sales_page"],"description":"organic (a post), ad (three openings by default), youtube (horizontal), sales_page."},"asset_ids":{"maxItems":50,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^src_[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{7,95}$"}},"music_staging_key":{"type":"string","pattern":"^stg_[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{7,95}$"}},"additionalProperties":false},"operation_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-zA-Z0-9_.:-]{1,100}$","description":"A stable ID for this request. Preserve it on retries. Use a new ID only for a deliberate new request."},"dry_run":{"description":"true: answer the credit cost and start nothing.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["items","operation_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"example":{"operation_id":"oct-week-1","defaults":{"seconds":30,"voice":"liam","sound_effects":true},"items":[{"idea":"3 habits that save an hour a day"},{"idea":"Why most morning routines fail"}]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Make up to 10 faceless videos","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Result"}}}},"400":{"description":"The request is invalid. The message names each field to fix.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A valid bearer token (API key or OAuth access token) is required.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"402":{"description":"This account has no allowance left for this, or does not include it. error.checkout_url is where to add it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"This needs publishing permission (scope clypmint.publish), or is not open on this account yet.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"The video, upload, memory or calendar was not found in this account.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Busy: an upload or edit is already running, the video changed, or too many upload links are waiting.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Clypmint could not apply it as asked; error.problems names each part.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"A daily limit was reached (direct edits, caption fixes, upload links).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"501":{"description":"This is not available on Clypmint yet; the message says what to use instead.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Clypmint is busy. Try again in a moment.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/schedule":{"post":{"operationId":"schedule_plan","summary":"Check, then schedule, a batch of posts","description":"Schedule many finished videos at once. First call with approve: false: it checks every slot (video ready, output, time 2 min to 60 days ahead, connected accounts) and changes nothing. Show the user the schedule; only after they say yes call again with approve: true, which schedules the ready ones and says which are still editing. Scheduling needs publishing permission. Never call approve: true without the user’s explicit yes. Cost: Free to schedule. Same as the MCP tool schedule_plan.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"items":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":31,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"video_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"The video id from list_videos."},"output_id":{"description":"Which output to post (from check_video); the main video when left out.","type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z0-9-]{1,80}$"},"platforms":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":3,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["INSTAGRAM","TIKTOK","YOUTUBE"]},"description":"INSTAGRAM, TIKTOK and/or YOUTUBE."},"post_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d(?::[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?)?(?:Z|([+-](?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d)))$"},"caption":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},"platform_options":{"type":"object","properties":{"TIKTOK":{"type":"object","properties":{"privacy":{"type":"string","enum":["SELF_ONLY","PUBLIC_TO_EVERYONE","MUTUAL_FOLLOW_FRIENDS","FOLLOWER_OF_CREATOR"]},"disableComments":{"type":"boolean"},"disableDuet":{"type":"boolean"},"disableStitch":{"type":"boolean"},"isAiGenerated":{"type":"boolean"},"isBrandContent":{"type":"boolean"},"isOrganicBrandContent":{"type":"boolean"},"consent":{"type":"boolean","const":true}},"required":["privacy","disableComments","disableDuet","disableStitch","isAiGenerated","isBrandContent","isOrganicBrandContent","consent"],"additionalProperties":false},"YOUTUBE":{"type":"object","properties":{"privacy":{"type":"string","enum":["PUBLIC","PRIVATE","UNLISTED"]},"madeForKids":{"type":"boolean"},"containsSyntheticMedia":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["privacy","madeForKids"],"additionalProperties":false}},"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["video_id","platforms","post_at","caption"],"additionalProperties":false}},"timezone":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"approve":{"type":"boolean","description":"false: check the schedule and change nothing. true: schedule the ready posts (publishing permission needed)."},"operation_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-zA-Z0-9_.:-]{1,100}$","description":"A stable ID for this request. Preserve it on retries. Use a new ID only for a deliberate new request."}},"required":["items","timezone","approve"],"additionalProperties":false},"example":{"timezone":"America/Chicago","approve":false,"items":[{"video_id":"prj_example","platforms":["INSTAGRAM"],"post_at":"2026-10-14T17:00:00-05:00","caption":"Day 1"}]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Check, then schedule, a batch of posts","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Result"}}}},"400":{"description":"The request is invalid. The message names each field to fix.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A valid bearer token (API key or OAuth access token) is required.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"402":{"description":"This account has no allowance left for this, or does not include it. error.checkout_url is where to add it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"This needs publishing permission (scope clypmint.publish), or is not open on this account yet.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"The video, upload, memory or calendar was not found in this account.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Busy: an upload or edit is already running, the video changed, or too many upload links are waiting.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Clypmint could not apply it as asked; error.problems names each part.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"A daily limit was reached (direct edits, caption fixes, upload links).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"501":{"description":"This is not available on Clypmint yet; the message says what to use instead.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Clypmint is busy. Try again in a moment.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/content-plans":{"post":{"operationId":"plan_content","summary":"Start a calendar of video ideas","description":"Start a content calendar for a topic: count faceless videos (1-31) over days (7-31), each with a title, hook, the exact script, caption, hashtags and a posting time. Best: write the ideas yourself in the conversation and send them as items (taken as written, at once); otherwise Clypmint writes them (this call keeps going until they are written, or tells you to call again with the same operation_id). Makes nothing and spends nothing; answers plan_id, the ideas and the quote (credits a video, room left this month). Show the user the ideas, change them with edit_content_plan, and approve_plan only after their yes. Use for \"start a faceless account\" or \"a month of posts about X\". Cost: Free to write; making each video costs about 4 credits (30 s). Same as the MCP tool plan_content.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"topic":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":500,"description":"What the account posts about."},"count":{"description":"How many videos (1-31); leave out when sending items.","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":31},"days":{"type":"integer","minimum":7,"maximum":31,"description":"Over how many days (7-31)."},"items":{"description":"Ideas you wrote yourself (title, hook, script, caption, hashtags): taken as written, at once. Without them Clypmint writes the ideas.","minItems":1,"maxItems":31,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"hook":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"script":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":1200,"description":"The exact words the narrator reads, about 2.5 words a second of video."},"caption":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},"hashtags":{"maxItems":10,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^#?[\\p{L}\\p{N}_]{1,60}$"}},"post_at":{"description":"Left out: Clypmint slots it.","type":"string","format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d(?::[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?)?(?:Z|([+-](?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d)))$"}},"required":["title","script"],"additionalProperties":false}},"start_at":{"description":"The first day; tomorrow when left out.","type":"string","format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d(?::[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?)?(?:Z|([+-](?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d)))$"},"timezone":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"platforms":{"description":"Where each post goes; Instagram when left out.","minItems":1,"maxItems":3,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["INSTAGRAM","TIKTOK","YOUTUBE"]}},"style_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z0-9-]{1,40}$"},"seconds":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number","const":15},{"type":"number","const":30},{"type":"number","const":60}]},"voice":{"type":"string","enum":["matilda","sarah","jessica","alice","liam","chris","brian","george","roger","laura","charlie","river","will","eric","bella","daniel","lily","bill","adam","callum","harry"],"description":"The narrator for a video made from words: matilda, sarah, jessica, alice, liam, chris, brian, george, roger, laura, charlie, river, will, eric, bella, daniel, lily, bill, adam, callum, harry (sarah: calm, reassuring, health and money; alice: a clear British educator; brian: deep documentary; liam: energetic ads). Leave out to let Clypmint pick one that fits the words. \"Voice: <name>\" in instructions does the same."},"audience":{"type":"string","maxLength":300},"instructions":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},"operation_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-zA-Z0-9_.:-]{1,100}$","description":"A stable ID for this request. Preserve it on retries. Use a new ID only for a deliberate new request."}},"required":["topic","days"],"additionalProperties":false},"example":{"topic":"Personal finance for nurses","days":30,"platforms":["INSTAGRAM","TIKTOK"],"items":[{"title":"The 3-bucket paycheck","hook":"Nurses: split every paycheck three ways.","script":"Nurses, split every paycheck three ways before you spend a cent..."}]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Start a calendar of video ideas","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Result"}}}},"400":{"description":"The request is invalid. The message names each field to fix.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A valid bearer token (API key or OAuth access token) is required.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"402":{"description":"This account has no allowance left for this, or does not include it. error.checkout_url is where to add it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"This needs publishing permission (scope clypmint.publish), or is not open on this account yet.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"The video, upload, memory or calendar was not found in this account.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Busy: an upload or edit is already running, the video changed, or too many upload links are waiting.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Clypmint could not apply it as asked; error.problems names each part.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"A daily limit was reached (direct edits, caption fixes, upload links).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"501":{"description":"This is not available on Clypmint yet; the message says what to use instead.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Clypmint is busy. Try again in a moment.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/content-plans/{id}/items":{"post":{"operationId":"edit_content_plan","summary":"Change, move or drop ideas","description":"Change ideas by number (n) before they are made or posted: title, hook, script, caption, hashtags, posting time, platforms, or removed: true to drop one (false puts it back). Words cannot change once an idea is being made; a scheduled post changes with update_post. Free. Cost: Free: no credits. Same as the MCP tool edit_content_plan.","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"items":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":31,"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"n":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":31},"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":80},"hook":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"script":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":1200},"caption":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000},"hashtags":{"maxItems":10,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^#?[\\p{L}\\p{N}_]{1,60}$"}},"post_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d(?::[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?)?(?:Z|([+-](?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d)))$"},"platforms":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":3,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["INSTAGRAM","TIKTOK","YOUTUBE"]}},"removed":{"description":"true takes the idea out; false puts it back.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["n"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"additionalProperties":false,"required":["items"]},"example":{"items":[{"n":3,"post_at":"2026-10-20T18:00:00-05:00"},{"n":7,"removed":true}]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Change, move or drop ideas","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Result"}}}},"400":{"description":"The request is invalid. The message names each field to fix.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A valid bearer token (API key or OAuth access token) is required.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"402":{"description":"This account has no allowance left for this, or does not include it. error.checkout_url is where to add it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"This needs publishing permission (scope clypmint.publish), or is not open on this account yet.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"The video, upload, memory or calendar was not found in this account.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Busy: an upload or edit is already running, the video changed, or too many upload links are waiting.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Clypmint could not apply it as asked; error.problems names each part.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"A daily limit was reached (direct edits, caption fixes, upload links).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"501":{"description":"This is not available on Clypmint yet; the message says what to use instead.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Clypmint is busy. Try again in a moment.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/content-plans/{id}/approve":{"post":{"operationId":"approve_plan","summary":"Make the approved ideas","description":"Make the videos for a calendar from plan_content: every idea, or the numbers given. Each then posts on its date once it is ready and the accounts are connected, so this needs publishing permission, TikTok/YouTube settings in platform_options when they are named, and the user’s explicit yes. dry_run: true answers the credits and the room left this month, and makes nothing; past the room it answers 402 with how many fit. Cost: About 4 credits per 30-second video. Same as the MCP tool approve_plan.","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"items":{"description":"The idea numbers (n) to make; every idea not removed when left out.","minItems":1,"maxItems":31,"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":31}},"platform_options":{"description":"TikTok and YouTube publishing settings, required when the ideas post there.","type":"object","properties":{"TIKTOK":{"type":"object","properties":{"privacy":{"type":"string","enum":["SELF_ONLY","PUBLIC_TO_EVERYONE","MUTUAL_FOLLOW_FRIENDS","FOLLOWER_OF_CREATOR"]},"disableComments":{"type":"boolean"},"disableDuet":{"type":"boolean"},"disableStitch":{"type":"boolean"},"isAiGenerated":{"type":"boolean"},"isBrandContent":{"type":"boolean"},"isOrganicBrandContent":{"type":"boolean"},"consent":{"type":"boolean","const":true}},"required":["privacy","disableComments","disableDuet","disableStitch","isAiGenerated","isBrandContent","isOrganicBrandContent","consent"],"additionalProperties":false},"YOUTUBE":{"type":"object","properties":{"privacy":{"type":"string","enum":["PUBLIC","PRIVATE","UNLISTED"]},"madeForKids":{"type":"boolean"},"containsSyntheticMedia":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["privacy","madeForKids"],"additionalProperties":false}},"additionalProperties":false},"operation_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-zA-Z0-9_.:-]{1,100}$","description":"A stable ID for this request. Preserve it on retries. Use a new ID only for a deliberate new request."},"dry_run":{"description":"true: answer the credit cost and make nothing.","type":"boolean"}},"additionalProperties":false},"example":{"items":[1,2,3]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Make the approved ideas","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Result"}}}},"400":{"description":"The request is invalid. The message names each field to fix.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A valid bearer token (API key or OAuth access token) is required.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"402":{"description":"This account has no allowance left for this, or does not include it. error.checkout_url is where to add it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"This needs publishing permission (scope clypmint.publish), or is not open on this account yet.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"The video, upload, memory or calendar was not found in this account.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Busy: an upload or edit is already running, the video changed, or too many upload links are waiting.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Clypmint could not apply it as asked; error.problems names each part.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"A daily limit was reached (direct edits, caption fixes, upload links).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"501":{"description":"This is not available on Clypmint yet; the message says what to use instead.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Clypmint is busy. Try again in a moment.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/content-plans/{id}/post":{"post":{"operationId":"post_content_plan","summary":"Schedule the ready videos of a calendar","description":"Schedule the ready videos of an approved calendar whose posts are waiting, after the user connected an account or picked a new time (all, or the numbers given). Needs publishing permission. Cost: Free to schedule. Same as the MCP tool post_content_plan.","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"items":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":31,"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":31}}},"additionalProperties":false}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Schedule the ready videos of a calendar","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Result"}}}},"400":{"description":"The request is invalid. The message names each field to fix.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A valid bearer token (API key or OAuth access token) is required.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"402":{"description":"This account has no allowance left for this, or does not include it. error.checkout_url is where to add it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"This needs publishing permission (scope clypmint.publish), or is not open on this account yet.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"The video, upload, memory or calendar was not found in this account.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Busy: an upload or edit is already running, the video changed, or too many upload links are waiting.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Clypmint could not apply it as asked; error.problems names each part.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"A daily limit was reached (direct edits, caption fixes, upload links).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"501":{"description":"This is not available on Clypmint yet; the message says what to use instead.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Clypmint is busy. Try again in a moment.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/content-plans/{id}":{"get":{"operationId":"get_content_plan","summary":"A content calendar and its progress","description":"Read a calendar from plan_content: each idea’s state (draft, making, ready, needs_connect, needs_time, scheduled, posted, failed), its video and post, and the quote. Cost: Free: no credits. Same as the MCP tool get_content_plan.","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"A content calendar and its progress","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Result"}}}},"400":{"description":"The request is invalid. The message names each field to fix.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"A valid bearer token (API key or OAuth access token) is required.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"402":{"description":"This account has no allowance left for this, or does not include it. error.checkout_url is where to add it.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"This needs publishing permission (scope clypmint.publish), or is not open on this account yet.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"The video, upload, memory or calendar was not found in this account.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Busy: an upload or edit is already running, the video changed, or too many upload links are waiting.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Clypmint could not apply it as asked; error.problems names each part.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"A daily limit was reached (direct edits, caption fixes, upload links).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"501":{"description":"This is not available on Clypmint yet; the message says what to use instead.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Clypmint is busy. Try again in a moment.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/videos/from-words":{"post":{"operationId":"create_video","summary":"Make a faceless video from an idea or a script","description":"Make a faceless video from an idea (Clypmint writes the narration) or an exact script, with no footage. 15, 30 or 60 seconds; formats, voice, style_id, sound_effects and instructions optional. dry_run: true answers the cost. Cost: About 4 credits for 30 seconds (3 credits to make, plus 1 for each started minute of voice-over and 1 for each started minute of finished video after the first, plus 2 for each extra format). Same as the MCP tool create_video.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"script":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":4000},"idea":{"type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":4000},"seconds":{"default":30,"description":"How long: 15, 30 or 60. With a script, leave it out: the script sets the length (about 2.5 words a second; at most 43 words for 15, 86 for 30, 172 for 60).","anyOf":[{"type":"number","const":15},{"type":"number","const":30},{"type":"number","const":60}]},"operation_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-zA-Z0-9_.:-]{1,100}$"},"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":120},"instructions":{"description":"Anything else the user asked for, in their own words: where each picture goes, the tone. Length, narrator, pictures and shapes go in their own fields. No rule lists. A link written here is not opened: import a picture first with import_asset.","type":"string","maxLength":8000},"style_id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z0-9-]{1,40}$"},"format":{"default":"vertical","type":"string","enum":["vertical","horizontal"]},"asset_ids":{"default":[],"maxItems":50,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^src_[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{7,95}$"}},"asset_staging_keys":{"default":[],"description":"Pictures the user wants shown (a portrait, a product shot, an app screen): import each with import_asset (its url) and list the keys here.","maxItems":50,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^stg_[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{7,95}$"}},"purpose":{"type":"string","enum":["organic","ad","youtube","sales_page"],"description":"organic (a post), ad (three openings by default), youtube (horizontal), sales_page."},"formats":{"minItems":1,"maxItems":4,"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["9:16","16:9","1:1","4:5"]},"description":"Every shape to make, the main one first: 9:16, 16:9, 1:1, 4:5."},"voice":{"type":"string","enum":["matilda","sarah","jessica","alice","liam","chris","brian","george","roger","laura","charlie","river","will","eric","bella","daniel","lily","bill","adam","callum","harry"],"description":"The narrator for a video made from words: matilda, sarah, jessica, alice, liam, chris, brian, george, roger, laura, charlie, river, will, eric, bella, daniel, lily, bill, adam, callum, harry (sarah: calm, reassuring, health and money; alice: a clear British educator; brian: deep documentary; liam: energetic ads). Leave out to let Clypmint pick one that fits the words. \"Voice: <name>\" in instructions does the same."},"sound_effects":{"type":"boolean"},"music_staging_key":{"description":"A song from import_asset (mp3, wav or m4a) to lay under the voice.","type":"string","pattern":"^stg_[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{7,95}$"},"style_version":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":10000},"dry_run":{"description":"true: answer the credit cost and start nothing.","type":"boolean"},"music_bed":{"description":"true: lay the style's own music bed under the narration (none unless asked); false: never. music_staging_key brings a song of your own instead.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["operation_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"example":{"idea":"Three ways to plan a calmer workday","seconds":30,"operation_id":"calm-1"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Make a faceless video from an idea or a script","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Result"}}}},"400":{"description":"The request is invalid. The message names each field to fix.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/comp